<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
  <main class="container my-5">
    <div class="card p-5 bg-dark text-light border-secondary mb-5">
      <h1 class="font-brand text-accent mb-3">Bem-vindo ao FandomArchive!</h1>
      <p class="fs-5 text-muted">O portal dedicado a abrigar comunidades, guias e dicas de jogos desafiadores, cults e esquecidos pelo tempo.</p>
      <div class="d-flex gap-3 mt-3">
        <a href="/guides/new" class="btn btn-primary-custom">+ Criar um Guia ou Dica</a>
        <a href="/games" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Ver Todos os Fandoms</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <div class="card p-4 bg-dark text-light border-secondary h-100">
          <h3 class="font-brand text-accent mb-3">🎮 Fandoms em Destaque</h3>
          <ul class="list-group list-group-flush bg-transparent">
            <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-light border-secondary">💀 Fear & Hunger</li>
            <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-light border-secondary">🌧️ Rain World</li>
            <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-light border-secondary">🏛️ La-Mulana</li>
            <li class="list-group-item bg-transparent text-light border-secondary">⏳ Pathologic 2</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/games" class="btn btn-outline-cyan btn-sm mt-3 align-self-start">Explorar Fandoms →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <div class="card p-4 bg-dark text-light border-secondary h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-brand text-accent mb-3">📖 Central de Guias</h3>
            <p class="text-muted">Acesse a lista completa de guias criados pela comunidade ou publique as suas próprias estratégias de sobrevivência.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/guides" class="btn btn-primary-custom align-self-start">Acessar Todos os Guias</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>